oads for faster loading\n\nRefactored skill discovery to download skills in parallel instead of sequentially,\n\nreducing load times when multiple skills need to be fetched from remote URLs.\n\nAlso updated AGENTS.md with guidance on using dev branch for diffs."},{"Sha":"266de27a0b56c29a3bdb81a5adb211f93214f5a8","Login":"thdxr","IsBot":false,"AuthorName":"Dax Raad","AuthorEmail":"d@ironbay.co","Date":"2026-02-06T05:29:43+00:00","Message":"feat(skill): add skill discovery from URLs via well-known RFC\n\nImplement the Agent Skills Discovery RFC to allow fetching skills from URLs:\n- Add \u0027urls\u0027 field to config.skills for specifying skill registry URLs\n- Create Discovery namespace in skill/discovery.ts with pull() function\n- Download skills from /.well-known/skills/index.json endpoints\n- Cache downloaded skills to ~/.cache/opencode/skills/\n- Skip re-downloading existing files for efficiency\n\nUsers can now configure:\n{\n  \u0022skills\u0022: {\n    \u0022urls\u0022: [\u0022https://example.com/.well-known/skills/\u0022]\n  }\n}\n\nImplements: https://github.com/cloudflare/agent-skills-discovery-rfc"},{"Sha":"0f1fdeceda453a07499b4fdc534b96d18a53aecd","Login":"fwang","IsBot":false,"AuthorName":"Frank","AuthorEmail":"frank@anoma.ly","Date":"2026-02-06T05:22:06+00:00","Message":"zen: fix usage graph"},{"Sha":"8bf97ef9e5a4039e80bfb3d565d4718da6114afd","Login":"Hona","IsBot":false,"AuthorName":"Luke Parker","AuthorEmail":"10430890\u002BHona@users.noreply.github.com","Date":"2026-02-06T02:15:34+00:00","Message":"chore: align windows test runner to blacksmith (#12364)"},{"Sha":"683d234d805e4d1097751d3cd583117856e41de5","Login":"AksharP5","IsBot":false,"AuthorName":"Akshar Patel","AuthorEmail":"123344143\u002BAksharP5@users.noreply.github.com","Date":"2026-02-06T02:11:08+00:00","Message":"feat(tui): highlight esc label on hover in dialog (#12383)"},{"Sha":"229cdafcc43ef53611a12dc2e8137575669e8706","Login":"hstove","IsBot":false,"AuthorName":"Hank Stoever","AuthorE